      "dot": "rose",
      "title": "Failures become evidence",
      "items": [
        "401 auth and 403 forbidden: denied",
        "timeout, 5xx unavailable, oversized page, bad shape invalid_output: missing",
        "Pages read before a failure are kept, so the result is partial"
